    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Caves of Combat is a fast-paced, ability-driven action roguelike where every run challenges you to master chaotic combat, discover game-breaking synergies, and confront the ancient force lurking below.<br><br>Beneath the surface lies a world twisted by time, filled with strange relics, hostile creatures, and a mysterious unrelenting force. You are not the first to descend \u2014 but you might be the last to survive.<br><br>Features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fluid, responsive melee combat</strong> \u2013 Strike, maneuver, and survive in high-stakes close-quarters action.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stackable abilities with wild synergies</strong> \u2013 Combine and scale your powers to take down tougher foes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging enemies and deadly boss fights</strong> \u2013 Face off against unique foes that test your skill and strategy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedurally generated levels</strong> \u2013 Explore shifting, unpredictable layouts every time you descend.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roguelike structure</strong> \u2013 Permanent death, fast runs, and the drive to go further with each attempt.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A hostile, mysterious world</strong> \u2013 The caves hold secrets, danger, and something watching from the dark\u2026</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Caves of Combat is a fast-paced, ability-driven action roguelike where every run challenges you to master chaotic combat, discover game-breaking synergies, and confront the ancient force lurking below.<br><br>Beneath the surface lies a world twisted by time, filled with strange relics, hostile creatures, and a mysterious unrelenting force. You are not the first to descend \u2014 but you might be the last to survive.<br><br>Features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fluid, responsive melee combat</strong> \u2013 Strike, maneuver, and survive in high-stakes close-quarters action.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stackable abilities with wild synergies</strong> \u2013 Combine and scale your powers to take down tougher foes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging enemies and deadly boss fights</strong> \u2013 Face off against unique foes that test your skill and strategy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedurally generated levels</strong> \u2013 Explore shifting, unpredictable layouts every time you descend.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roguelike structure</strong> \u2013 Permanent death, fast runs, and the drive to go further with each attempt.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A hostile, mysterious world</strong> \u2013 The caves hold secrets, danger, and something watching from the dark\u2026</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
